{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"3f2efbdc3494c208749a6df24b559b29a7821e0a0e71faf22838e887d3046eeb","digest":{"component_or_area":"git store transient retry","key_entities":["gitutil.run_git_write","gitutil._is_transient_head_error","gitutil._with_transient_head_retry","gitutil._TRANSIENT_HEAD_MARKERS","gitutil._TRANSIENT_OBJECT_MARKERS","event_append._TRANSIENT_ADD_MARKERS","event_append._with_transient_add_retry","gitutil._TRANSIENT_WRITE_MARKERS","gitutil._is_transient_object_write_error","gitutil._is_transient_git_fault","gitutil._with_transient_fault_retry","src/rebar/_store/gitutil.py","src/rebar/_store/event_append.py","tests/unit/test_gitutil_transient_write_retry.py","tests/interfaces/store/test_event_append_transient_retry.py","tests/unit/test_run_git_wrapper.py"],"problem_keywords":["transient retry","write-side fault","git operations","temp file","runner-FS","loose object","git write seam"],"propositions":["Write-side transient runner-FS faults (unable to create temporary file, failed to insert into database, unable to index file) are not retried by gitutil.run_git_write because _with_transient_head_retry matches only read-side markers","The identical write-side fault markers exist in event_append._TRANSIENT_ADD_MARKERS and are retried only for git add/commit paths, leaving other run_git_write callers (s3_doctor, compaction, claim/transition writers) unprotected","Moving write-side marker definitions from event_append to gitutil and folding them into a unified transient fault classifier ensures all run_git_write callers inherit bounded retry protection with a single definition","Corrupt-object signatures (loose object is corrupt, inflate: data stream error) and index.lock faults remain excluded from retry to preserve immediate surfacing of genuine persistent faults"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787907941123273001,"uuid":"dca334d6-bdb4-4dbd-8cd3-534b7109e961"}